OL,3,GNEWSAPrime Minister hints at
OL,4,Aannouncement on A46 bypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister has said there will
OL,7,Fbe an announcement soon over the future
OL,8,Fof the upgrade of the A46 bypass around
OL,9,FNewark.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham also promised there was
OL,12,F"no way" the East Midlands would lose
OL,13,Fout when it came to infrastructure
OL,14,Fprojects in general.
OL,16,FComplaints the region was being
OL,17,F"defunded" arose after former Prime
OL,18,FMinister Sir Keir Starmer announced in
OL,19,FJune that some transport projects would
OL,20,Fbe abandoned - but the only two named
OL,21,Fwere the A38 in Derbyshire and A46 in
OL,22,FNottinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
