OL,3,GNEWSAPrime Minister hints at
OL,4,Aannouncement on A46 bypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham acknowledged reports the A46
OL,7,Fproject had gone out for retendering
OL,8,Fand said "a lot of work has been going
OL,9,Fon to see what's possible and further
OL,10,Fannouncements will be made in due
OL,11,Fcourse".
